# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Phase 4 recovery: keep the *.backup files TRACKED.
#
# The repository root .gitignore has a blanket `*.backup` rule (line 62) for
# scratch files. Here those two files are the opposite of scratch:
#
#   app/build.gradle.kts.backup        -- the project's own ORIGINAL module
#                                         build script (4 Sep 2026, 1585 B).
#                                         The live app/build.gradle.kts was
#                                         truncated to 0 bytes on 5 Sep, so
#                                         this file is the only surviving
#                                         record of the working configuration
#                                         and the baseline the repair is
#                                         derived from.
#   gradle/wrapper/*.properties.backup -- the original wrapper pointing at the
#                                         official distribution URL, before it
#                                         was repointed at a local file:// zip.
#
# Without these negations `git add android` silently skips both and the
# recovery baseline is lost again. Do not remove.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!app/build.gradle.kts.backup
!gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.properties.backup
